Package: escrow-shims
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Escrow OS Team <team@escrow-os.invalid>
Depends: escrow (= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: start AI agent CLIs inside escrow by default
 Puts shims for claude, codex, gemini, copilot, goose and aider first on PATH
 (via /etc/profile.d/escrow.sh). Each shim runs the real agent through
 `escrow run` with the profile from /etc/escrow/agents.d/<agent>.toml.
 Inside a session the shims run the agent directly, so sessions never nest.
